0,West Papua Music - YouTube,https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLnOSH5j1sQh_2l75fHfbp91Lu72FYJqHI,"Indonesian influence is felt in West Papuan music. Ethnically many eastern Indonesian island people are Melanesian as well, such as the people of Maluku and the Aru Islands, etc.",Ibu,West Papuan
