2,Free West Papua Vanuatu Support | IBU TIDAK COCOK UNTUK ... - Facebook,https://www.facebook.com/groups/664710670355199/permalink/3608458405980396/,"IBU TIDAK COCOK UNTUK KUTUKAN SESAMA MANUSIA, MASA KO TIDAK BICARA KEMANUSIAAN RAKYAT SIPIL PAPUA DAN AKAR MASALAH BARU. STOP CARI PERHATIAN DAN MUSLIHAT TERHADAP RAKYAT PAPUA. LEBIH BAGUS IBU UNDANG...",Ibu,West Papuan
3,Music - Office of Benny Wenda,https://www.bennywenda.org/music/,"Benny and his family play traditional West Papuan music as the Lani Singers. Music and dance has always been a key component in West Papuan culture. In life and in death, ceremonies and in private, music is the binding force amongst the people. Although the styles of music differ from coastal communities to those in the highland...",Ibu,West Papuan
4,Music - Free West Papua Campaign,https://www.freewestpapua.org/resources/music/,"Music There have been a number of albums released in recent years in support of the Free West Papua movement. These span from music recorded by West Papuans (including Mambesak and the Lani Singers), through to compilation releases featuring artists supportive of the cause.",Ibu,West Papuan
5,The Spirit of Mambesak West Papuan Freedom Music,https://commonslibrary.org/the-spirit-of-mambesak-west-papuan-freedom-music/,"Introduction An introduction to West Papuan protest songs and the courageous artists and activists behind West Papuan Freedom music. The Music of West Papuan Freedom Arnold Ap and Mambesak It always takes an element of courage to sing protest songs, but few musicians have ever faced the same consequences as Arnold Ap.",Ibu,West Papuan
6,West Papua : Spirit of Mambesak | Various | Wantok Musik,https://wantokmusik.bandcamp.com/album/west-papua-spirit-of-mambesak,"Then music and songs continue to be the substance that binds indigenous groups together, as well as enabling freedom of expression. Back in the 70's and 80's West Papuan artists like Arnold AP and Eddie Mofu understood this and formed the cultural music group Mambesak to revitalise traditional West Papuan dance, music, and song.",Ibu,West Papuan
7,West Papuan Gospel Songs - Facebook,https://www.facebook.com/groups/westpapuangospelsongs/,West Papuans are gifted in singing and have beautiful unique voices..You can listen to various christian artist and their songs in this group.West Papua is the land of peace and Jesus is Lord over West Papua.,Ibu,West Papuan
8,PDF 'Music Helps a West Papuan Feeling': Transporting Selves and Moving Others,https://sebsalay.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/bfe_music-helps-a-west-papuan-feeling-transporting-selves-and-moving-others_salay.pdf,"In this paper I show how music transports West Papuan musicians, how they then use music to move their audiences, and how this supports the broader political movement. I also consider forms of immobility that contextualise these movements. Looking at these multiple, contrapuntal movements and immobilities contributes to my broader, theoretical argument that musicking has affective power to ...",Ibu,West Papuan
